  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Fort. Capacidades Nacionales para Gestin Integral de Residuos y Desecho Slidos</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthen National Capacity for Integrated Solid Waste Management</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo general del programa ser apoyar la estrategia del Gobierno de la Republica Bolivariana de Venezuela (RBVE) para mejorar la gestin integral de los Residuos Slidos Municipales (RSM) a nivel nacional, con el fin de reducir los impactos en salud y medio ambiente asociados a su inadecuado manejo.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The programs general objective is to support the strategy of the Government of the Bolivarian Republic of Venezuela to improve the integrated management of municipal solid waste at the national level, in order to reduce the health and environmental impacts associated with inadequate waste management.</narrative>
  </description>
